| **Parameter** | **Required** | **Values**                                                                       |
| ------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |

| enableSnapshot       | No           | Enable snapshot functionality for the bucket. Default is `false`. Please note only the Standard storage tier is supported for snapshot-enabled buckets                   |
